From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:51:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Pack winemetal render batches into the remote wire format

Converts a real wmtcmd_* list into contiguous records with offset-based
sidecars, for the 15 render opcodes a D3D11 cube emits. Bounded and
cycle-checked; unsupported opcodes fail by name with encoder kind, opcode and
record index.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01M1HvfVX2Y29TgJbFWbahdt
Madeira-commit: 9160a147fe2e0b52d8c665648795f9f7d928f009
Rebased: clean
